      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "先运行 workflow_save_session.json；刷新页面并选择会话，再运行本画布加载波形。点击编辑器展开，剪切/插入停顿/调整角色音量与静音，应用后重新运行以保存。\nSave a session first, select it after refresh, and Run to load the waveform. Open the editor, adjust cuts/pauses/voice gain or mute, then apply and Run to save.\n默认保留原始音频；align_words=false 使用句级字幕。逐词字幕须填好单文件或目录 aligner_path，再启用 align_words。\nAudio is unchanged by default. Set your aligner path and enable align_words for word timing.\nSaveSession 保留非破坏剪辑；字幕保存为 .txt（内容为 SRT，可改为 .srt）。所有模型与用户音频均不随工作流分发。\nSaveSession preserves nondestructive edits; the saved .txt contains SRT and can be renamed .srt.\n[本机安装] 参考音频 = ref_host.wav（占位）。请替换为 D:\\ComfyUI\\input 下你自己的音色样本。\n[Local install] reference audio = ref_host.wav (placeholder). Replace with your own voice sample in D:\\ComfyUI\\input.\n[本机安装] 模型路径使用绝对路径（model_path / codec_path），指向 J:\\ComfyUI-Shared\\models；下拉框中的文件名在权重落盘并重启 ComfyUI 后自动生效。\n[Local install] model_path / codec_path are absolute paths into J:\\ComfyUI-Shared\\models; the dropdown file names become legal once the weights are on disk and ComfyUI has been restarted."
      ],
      "title": "使用说明 / Instructions"
    }
